{"ref":"BDB, עָמֵק","hw":"עָמֵק","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָמֵק</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. deep, unfathomable</strong>;—pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִמְקֵי שָׂפָה</span> (Ges<sup>§ 93 ii</sup>) i.e. <em>unintelligible of speech</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.19\">Is 33:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.5\">Ez 3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.6\">6</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.18\">Pr 9:18</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֹ֫מֶק\" href=\"/BDB,_עֹ֫מֶק\", dir=\"rtl\">עֹמֶק</a>.","next":"BDB, עָמֹק²","prev":"BDB, עֹ֫מֶק"}